## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical understanding of end-to-end consistency in microservices and the ability to implement basic saga orchestration with clear compensation paths.

## Key Concepts
- Saga orchestration (in-process), event-sourcing, idempotence via correlationId and eventId, outbox pattern, simple state machine, compensation

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: handle OrderCreated and emit ReserveInventory
function handleOrderCreated(evt){
  if (isDuplicate(evt.correlationId, evt.eventId)) return;
  emit({ type: 'ReserveInventory', payload: { orderId: evt.orderId, items: evt.items } });
  sagaState[evt.orderId] = { step: 'InventoryReserved' };
}
```

